{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"prompt\": \"Minecraft builder reference sheet, landscape 3:2, plain light background, crisp vanilla Minecraft voxel style, no characters or animals. Two views side by side, LEFT straight-on north/front elevation orthographic, RIGHT three-quarter north-east view at the same block scale. Show the same entire house and lot in both views. Skilled human builder quality with substantial massing, projecting details, recessed framed openings, authentic stepped roof verges/eaves/ridges and sub-block stairs, slabs, fences, walls, trapdoors and lanterns.\\n\\nSite: suburban McMansion seen from the street (north), 44 blocks wide x 32 deep, two storeys plus attic, 14 blocks tall to the highest entry ridge including lawn and driveway, flat cul-de-sac lot with manicured green lawn. Left: 18-wide three-car garage wing, beige birch siding over stone-veneer base, three 4-wide carriage-style doors built of spruce panels with glass windows above, separated by lantern posts, hipped dark-asphalt roof. Wide gray concrete driveway flares toward street. Centre: tall 10-wide gable-fronted entry, highest ridge of house, two-storey portico with FOUR white quartz columns, white pediment, double dark oak doors under fanlight, three stone steps from polished-andesite walk. Right of entry: round-ish polygonal turret bay in stone veneer, tall glass windows, conical stepped dark roof and rod finial. Main block behind: jumble of hipped dark deepslate-tile roofs with flat decks and TWO small gabled dormers. Big stone-brick chimney on right with TWO pots. Lower front stone veneer, upper beige birch siding, white trim, alternating corner quoins. Tall arched 3-wide windows with upside-down quartz stairs in top corners, black iron shutters. Foundation shrubs of leaves and azalea along front wall, young oak with oak fence stake near driveway. Back: spruce deck with fence rail and sliding glass door, visible where possible in right view. Use only vanilla blocks. Do not introduce other materials.\\n\\nExact block palette by role:\\nstone veneer: stone_bricks, chiseled_stone_bricks, stone_brick_stairs, stone_brick_slab, stone_brick_wall\\nplinth: cobblestone\\nbeige siding: birch_planks, birch_stairs, birch_slab, birch_fence\\nwhite trim: smooth_quartz, white_concrete, quartz_pillar, smooth_quartz_stairs, smooth_quartz_slab\\nroof asphalt: deepslate_tiles, deepslate_tile_stairs, deepslate_tile_slab, deepslate_tile_wall\\nshutters: iron_trapdoor, dark_oak_trapdoor\\nwindows: glass_pane, white_stained_glass_pane, glass\\ndoors: dark_oak_door, spruce_door, birch_door\\ngarage door: spruce_planks, spruce_trapdoor, glass_pane, spruce_fence\\ndriveway: gray_concrete, polished_andesite_slab\\npath: polished_andesite\\nlawn: grass_block\\nshrubs: oak_leaves, flowering_azalea_leaves\\ntree: oak_log, oak_leaves, oak_fence\\ndeck: spruce_planks, spruce_stairs, spruce_fence, spruce_slab\\ninterior floors: spruce_planks, oak_planks, polished_andesite\\nlights: lantern, iron_chain, end_rod\\nflowers: rose_bush, peony, lilac, allium, cornflower\\nfunctional/decor objects: lightning_rod, iron_bars.\\nInclude small unobtrusive view captions FRONT / THREE-QUARTER and dimension guides 44 x 32 / height 14. Prioritize the architecture and readable block textures over text. Constraints: no characters or animals.\",\n  \"roles\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"stone veneer\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"stone_bricks\", \"chiseled_stone_bricks\", \"stone_brick_stairs\", \"stone_brick_slab\", \"stone_brick_wall\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"plinth\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"cobblestone\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"beige siding\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"birch_planks\", \"birch_stairs\", \"birch_slab\", \"birch_fence\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"white trim\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"smooth_quartz\", \"white_concrete\", \"quartz_pillar\", \"smooth_quartz_stairs\", \"smooth_quartz_slab\"]\n    },\n    {\n 